    "My occasional interest in newer pop does not mean I am currently looking for newer albums broadly; 25 feels less relevant than the older collections here."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "The repeated connection to sixties pop, folk, and classic rock matters alongside my preference for best-of collections.",
    "My choices are selective even among plausible matches: Lynyrd Skynyrd fits, but I would choose the Eagles collection first right now."
